{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42634","headline":"春日寓感 · 王延彬","name":"春日寓感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两衙前後讼堂清，软锦披袍拥鼻行。\n雨後绿苔侵履迹，春深红杏锁莺声。\n因携久酝松醪酒，自煮新抽竹笋羹。\n也解爲诗也爲政，侬家何似谢宣城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王延彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}